usage: check_vit.py [-h] [--substrate] [--device DEVICE] [--repeats {1,2,3}]
                    --run-dir RUN_DIR [--cache-dir CACHE_DIR] [--profile]
                    [--allow-weight-download]

Small RNGD preflight. Never installs packages, rewrites ops, or removes
caches. Default: ViT; --substrate: BF16 addition API check, never a ViT
benchmark. Use an external `timeout` to bound compiler/runtime waits.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --substrate
  --device DEVICE
  --repeats {1,2,3}
  --run-dir RUN_DIR
  --cache-dir CACHE_DIR
                        Explicit opt-in reuse of a private compiler cache
  --profile             Extra profiled calls AFTER unprofiled measurements
  --allow-weight-download
